# Every pane kind splits (src/app/cmd_view.zig `splitCompanion`, Rust's
# `split_active`): the split chips on a request pane put a blank request
# beside it, on a cheatsheet a scratch editor — never the raw error tag
# a toast used to spell (`Split editor right (side by side): NotAnEditor`).
command http.new
expect screen contains "Enter request URL"
command view.split_right
expect screen lacks "NotAnEditor"
expect screen contains "┌ Method ────┐┌ URL"
# Two request panes side by side: two Send boxes on the same row.
expect screen contains "▶ Send │"
command view.cheatsheet
command view.split_down
expect screen lacks "NotAnEditor"
expect screen lacks "needs an editor pane"
# A command that needs an editor, run from the cheatsheet: a sentence.
command view.close_split
command editor.goto_line
expect screen contains "needs an editor pane"
